But I've got to rush and take everyone to the concert venue right now,

8
00:06:24,308 --> 00:06:26,308
一緒に行ってくれるか？
so will you come along with me?

9
00:06:26,308 --> 00:06:27,808
行くぞー！
Here we go!

10
00:06:28,008 --> 00:06:32,808
熱くなった銀のメタリックハート
My silver, metallic heart has heated up

11
00:06:33,308 --> 00:06:38,808
導火線に火をつけてあげる
I'll light the fuse for you

12
00:06:39,008 --> 00:06:43,808
不思議なほどハイな気分さ
I'm feeling strangely high

13
00:06:44,308 --> 00:06:49,608
砂埃を巻き上げて行こう
Let's kick up the dust and go

14
00:06:49,908 --> 00:06:55,708
悲鳴をまじらせ暴走する鼓動
