15
00:06:56,108 --> 00:07:01,508
目の前にはミサイルの雨
Ahead of us is a shower of missiles

16
00:07:12,508 --> 00:07:17,408
アドレナリンずっと流して
With adrenaline constantly flowing

17
00:07:17,708 --> 00:07:23,308
僕の方がオーバーヒートしそう
Feels like I'm the one about to overheat

18
00:07:23,608 --> 00:07:28,508
爆発して灰になっても
Even if I explode and turn to ash

19
00:07:28,708 --> 00:07:34,108
このままだと笑ってるね きっと
I'm sure I'll still be laughing just like this

20
00:07:34,308 --> 00:07:39,508
街を追い越して この世の果てまで
Overtaking the town, all the way to the ends of the earth

21
00:07:39,708 --> 00:07:45,508
ぶっ飛ばして心中しよう さぁ手を伸ばして
Let's speed away and go out together, come on, reach out your hand!

22
00:07:45,808 --> 00:07:50,708
地平線に届くように
