カルマ
作詞・作曲: 藤原基央
[Karma]
[Lyrics & Music: Motoo Fujiwara]

206
00:22:17,771 --> 00:22:22,571
ガラス玉ひとつ 落とされた 追いかけてもうひとつ落っこちた
A single glass marble was dropped; chasing after it, another one tumbled down.

207
00:22:22,871 --> 00:22:27,571
ひとつ分の陽だまりに ひとつだけ残ってる
In a patch of sunlight meant for one, only one remains.

208
00:22:27,871 --> 00:22:32,371
心臓が始まった時 嫌でも人は場所を取る
From the moment a heart starts beating, like it or not, a person takes up space.

209
00:22:32,571 --> 00:22:36,871
奪われない様に 守り続けてる
Constantly protecting it so it won't be stolen away.

210
00:22:37,071 --> 00:22:41,771
汚さずに保ってきた 手でも汚れて見えた
Even the hands kept untainted began to look dirty.

211
00:22:41,971 --> 00:22:47,371
記憶を疑う前に 記憶に疑われてる
Before I could doubt my memories, I was being doubted by them.

212
00:22:47,871 --> 00:22:52,071
必ず僕らは出会うだろう
Surely, we are destined to meet,

213
00:22:52,371 --> 00:22:58,871
同じ鼓動の音を目印にして
guided by the sound of the very same heartbeat.

214
00:22:59,271 --> 00:23:02,271
ここに居るよ いつだって呼んでるから
I am right here; because I'm always calling out to you.

215
00:23:02,571 --> 00:23:09,171
くたびれた理由が 重なって揺れる時 生まれた意味を知る
When worn-out reasons overlap and sway, we come to understand the meaning of being born.

216
00:23:09,771 --> 00:23:14,571
存在が続く限り 仕方ないから場所を取る
As long as our existence continues, we have no choice but to take up space.

217
00:23:14,771 --> 00:23:19,171
ひとつ分の陽だまりに ふたつはちょっと入れない
In a patch of sunlight meant for one, two just cannot fit.

218
00:23:19,571 --> 00:23:24,371
ガラス玉ひとつ 落とされた 落ちた時 何か弾き出した
A single glass marble was dropped; when it fell, it pushed something out.

219
00:23:24,571 --> 00:23:28,671
奪い取った場所で 光を浴びた
Basking in the light at the spot stolen away.

220
00:23:28,971 --> 00:23:33,671
数えた足跡など 気付けば数字でしかない
The footprints I counted, when realized, are nothing more than numbers.

221
00:23:33,971 --> 00:23:39,071
知らなきゃいけない事は どうやら1と0の間
What we truly need to know lies somewhere between 1 and 0.

222
00:23:39,471 --> 00:23:44,071
初めて僕らは出会うだろう
For the very first time, we will meet,

223
00:23:44,371 --> 00:23:50,971
同じ悲鳴の旗を目印にして
guided by the flag of our matching screams.

224
00:23:51,271 --> 00:23:54,471
忘れないで いつだって呼んでるから
Don't forget; because I'm always calling out to you.

225
00:23:54,671 --> 00:24:01,371
重なった理由を ふたりで埋める時 約束が交わされる
When the two of us bury those overlapping reasons, a promise is exchanged.

226
00:24:01,771 --> 00:24:06,471
鏡なんだ 僕ら互いに
We are mirrors to one another,

227
00:24:06,671 --> 00:24:11,271
それぞれのカルマを映すための
meant to reflect each of our respective karmas.

228
00:24:11,571 --> 00:24:20,371
汚れた手と手で触り合って 形が解る
Touching with our stained hands, we understand each other's form.

229
00:24:20,571 --> 00:24:25,571
ここに居るよ 確かに触れるよ
I am right here; you can truly touch me.

230
00:24:25,771 --> 00:24:30,571
ひとり分の陽だまりに 僕らはいる
In a patch of sunlight meant for one, here we are.

231
00:24:30,771 --> 00:24:35,571
忘れないで いつだって呼んでるから
Don't forget; because I'm always calling out to you,

232
00:24:35,771 --> 00:24:40,671
同じガラス玉の内側のほうから
from inside the very same glass marble.

233
00:24:40,871 --> 00:24:45,771
そうさ 必ず僕らは出会うだろう
That's right, we are surely destined to meet.

234
00:24:46,071 --> 00:24:54,571
沈めた理由に十字架を立てる時 約束は果たされる
When we erect a cross upon the sunken reasons, the promise will be fulfilled.

235
00:24:55,071 --> 00:24:59,571
僕らは ひとつになる
We will become one.

236
00:25:00,117 --> 00:25:07,617
Woah...

237
00:25:50,917 --> 00:25:53,717
今日も君は 信じること
Today, were you able to wake up

238
00:25:53,717 --> 00:25:56,917
忘れずに目覚められていますか？
without forgetting what you believe in?

239
00:25:56,917 --> 00:26:01,917
時が経つと 自分さえも信じれなくなる時代のようです
As time passes, it seems we live in an era where we can't even believe in ourselves.

240
00:26:02,117 --> 00:26:07,717
自分では気付かないのが この症状の特徴で
The characteristic of this symptom is that you don't even realize it yourself,

241
00:26:07,717 --> 00:26:10,617
唯一ある予防法…は
and the only preventive measure... is:

242
00:26:10,617 --> 00:26:14,417
「自分にウソだけゃつかない事」
"Never lie to yourself."

243
00:26:14,517 --> 00:26:17,317
忘れてたまるもんかよ！！
As if I'd ever forget!!

244
00:26:17,317 --> 00:26:20,517
僕がボクじゃなくなったら
If I'm no longer myself,

245
00:26:20,517 --> 00:26:25,917
たとえ生きてたって 生きてる意味すら見つからんだろ
even if I were alive, I wouldn't even find a reason to live!

246
00:26:26,117 --> 00:26:30,417
声にならない叫びは 僕が声を枯らして
For these soundless screams, I'll scream until my voice gives out,

247
00:26:30,417 --> 00:26:33,417
叫んで歌って
screaming and singing,

248
00:26:33,417 --> 00:26:36,617
伝わるまでわめいて
shouting until it gets through,

249
00:26:36,617 --> 00:26:39,517
届くまで止めない！！
and I won't stop until it reaches you!!

250
00:26:49,917 --> 00:26:52,917
今日も地球は 回り続ける
Today too, the world keeps on spinning,

251
00:26:52,917 --> 00:26:56,317
誰が泣いても 怒っても止まらず
never stopping whether someone cries or gets angry.

252
00:26:56,317 --> 00:26:57,917
ためしに僕が…
Just to test it, even if I...

253
00:26:57,917 --> 00:27:01,917
風邪をひいても もちろん止まる事なんてねーわ！！
catch a cold, of course it's not gonna stop!!

254
00:27:01,917 --> 00:27:07,617
人生も同じように 止まる事はなく進むし
Life moves forward just the same without ever stopping,

255
00:27:07,617 --> 00:27:13,617
だから そうさ今日も人は お手手のシワとシワをあわせんの！！
so yeah, people put the wrinkles of their hands together in prayer today too!!

256
00:27:13,617 --> 00:27:19,417
終わらせちまう事なんか 誰にだってできんだろ？！
Anyone can easily just end it, right?!

257
00:27:19,417 --> 00:27:25,617
たとえ終わっちまったって 次のスタートすぐきれんだろ？！
Even if it came to an end, you can immediately make the next start, right?!

258
00:27:25,617 --> 00:27:30,917
今キミが思うキセキも 底上げさせてしまえば
