259
00:27:30,917 --> 00:27:38,317
もうその時点でそのキセキは 君にとっちゃ必然のお仲間さ！！
at that point, that miracle becomes your inevitable companion!!

260
00:27:38,617 --> 00:27:44,317
WOW！！
Woah!!

261
00:27:44,317 --> 00:27:52,617
ダン ダンダ ダン ダン ダン...
Dan, dan da dan, dan, dan...

262
00:28:11,617 --> 00:28:18,617
Without you...

263
00:28:18,617 --> 00:28:22,617
WOW！ 何回ダメダメと言われようが
Woah! No matter how many times they tell me "No way,"

264
00:28:22,617 --> 00:28:24,917
実際問題そんなん関係なくて
when it comes down to it, none of that matters!

265
00:28:24,917 --> 00:28:29,817
今自分自身 必要なものたくわえてそろえとけよ！！
Right now, stock up and prepare everything you yourself need!!

266
00:28:29,817 --> 00:28:33,317
なぁそうだろ？！ まだまだ！！ 時間はまだあんぞ！！
Hey, isn't that right?! Not yet, not yet!! There's still time!!

