君と集まって星座になれたら
If you and I could come together and form a constellation,

281
00:30:43,872 --> 00:30:48,572
空見上げて 指を差されるような
people would look up at the sky and point at us.

282
00:30:48,772 --> 00:30:52,572
繋いだ線 解かないで
Don't untie the line connecting us,

283
00:30:52,772 --> 00:30:57,172
僕がどんなに眩しくても
no matter how dazzling I might be.

284
00:31:03,572 --> 00:31:07,172
もうすぐ時計は8時
Soon the clock will strike eight,

285
00:31:07,372 --> 00:31:11,272
夜空に満天の星
the night sky full of stars.

286
00:31:11,472 --> 00:31:20,572
何億光年 離れたところには もうないかもしれない
Hundreds of millions of light-years away, they might not even be there anymore.

287
00:31:21,072 --> 00:31:29,072
月が綺麗で 泣きそうになるのは
The reason the beautiful moon brings me to tears

288
00:31:29,472 --> 00:31:35,972
いつの日にか 別れが来るから
is because someday, a farewell will come.

289
00:31:36,272 --> 00:31:40,172
君と集まって星座になれたら
If you and I could come together and form a constellation...

290
00:31:40,372 --> 00:31:44,972
彗星みたい 流れるひとりごと
A monologue drifting like a comet,

291
00:31:45,372 --> 00:31:52,172
消えていく残像は 真夜中のプリズム
the fading afterimage is a midnight prism.

292
00:31:52,472 --> 00:31:56,272
君と集まって星座になれたら
If you and I could come together and form a constellation,

293
00:31:56,472 --> 00:32:00,872
切なる願い 誰かに届いたら
if my earnest wish could reach someone,

294
00:32:01,072 --> 00:32:04,772
変われるかな 夜のふちを
could I change? Even someone like me,

295
00:32:04,972 --> 00:32:09,872
なぞるような こんな僕でも
who merely traces the edges of the night.

296
00:32:23,072 --> 00:32:30,772
はるか彼方 僕らは出会ってしまった
Far away in the distance, we happened to meet.

297
00:32:31,072 --> 00:32:38,172
カルマだから 何度も出会ってしまうよ
Because it's karma, we'll keep meeting again and again,

298
00:32:38,672 --> 00:32:43,172
雲の隙間で
through the gaps in the clouds.

299
00:32:43,472 --> 00:32:47,372
君と集まって星座になれたら
If you and I could come together and form a constellation,

300
00:32:47,672 --> 00:32:52,272
夜を広げて 描こう絵空事
let's spread out the night and paint our daydreams.

301
00:32:52,472 --> 00:32:59,772
暗闇を照らすような 満月じゃなくても
Even if we're not a full moon lighting up the dark,

302
00:32:59,972 --> 00:33:03,872
だから集まって星座になりたい
that's why I want to gather and become a constellation,

303
00:33:04,072 --> 00:33:08,172
色とりどりの光 放つような
casting a brilliance of colorful light.

304
00:33:08,372 --> 00:33:12,072
繋いだ線 解かないよ
I won't untie the line connecting us,

305
00:33:12,372 --> 00:33:17,872
君がどんなに眩しくても
no matter how dazzling you might be.

306
00:33:32,172 --> 00:33:35,672
はい！ということでね！FLOW GLOWでー！
